<title>USA: NHP Inc Q4 net income rise.</title>
<headline>NHP Inc Q4 net income rise.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>FULL YEAR ENDED DECEMBER 31</p>
<p>				 1996	 1995   Increase.(Decrease)</p>
<p> Adjusted Revenue*	$92,561    $57,425   $35,136   61.2%</p>
<p> EBITDA		     $34,247    $23,402   $10,845   46.3%</p>
<p> EBITDA per share	 $  2.67    $  1.82   $  0.85   46.3%</p>
<p>					     FOURTH QUARTER</p>
<p>			     1996	 1995     Increase (Decrease)</p>
<p> Adjusted Revenue*    $29,112    $16,385    $12,727    77.7%</p>
<p> EBITDA		   $11,128    $ 7,018    $ 4,110    58.6%</p>
<p> EBITDA per shr	 $  0.87    $  0.55    $  0.32    58.6%</p>
<p>* Adjusted revenue excludes revenues related to on-site personnel and general and administrative cost reimbursement.</p>
<p>**Based on 12,862,180 common and equivalent shares outstanding at 12/31/96.</p>
</text>
